  "description": "YITAMOTOR floor mats completely line the interior carpet to provide all-encompassing protection. We are confident that our products will surpass your expectations and make you a happy customer!\nFitment\n2007-2013 Chevy Silverado/ GMC Sierra 1500\n2007-2014 Chevy Silverado / Sierra 2500/3500HD Crew Cab\nDoes not fit vehicles with vinyl flooring,ONLY for carpet flooring.\nFor your safety, professional installation is highly recommended.\nFeatures\nCompatibility: YITAMOTOR floor mats use digital technology are compatible with 2007-2013 Chevy Silverado/GMC Sierra 1500, 2007-2014 Silverado/Sierra 2500 HD/3500 HD Crew Cab. Does not fit Extended/Standard Cab, and without 4x4 manual shifter. 3D laser scanning technology gives full protection to both the front and back. These mats are not for vehicles with vinyl flooring\nSturdy & Safe: YITAMOTOR floor liners are made from safe, high-density TPE material. The product contains no latex, cadmium, lead, or harmful PVC's, and provides comfort, extreme wear-resistance, and flexibility even in harsh cold\nAll-Season Protection: Enjoy full protection with our car mats, featuring anti-slip retainer clips, a textured surface that helps keep cargo from shifting, and raised lip designed to trap liquids, debris, snow, mud, sand, and other elements\nEasy Maintenance: Cleaning our floor liner is a breeze; simply remove, shake off, and hose down to achieve a pristine look. No need for vacuuming or harsh chemicals, ensuring a no-hassle maintenance\nWhy Choose Yitamotor: Our floor mats are processed with advanced technology, rendering tailored protection and all-weather guard to your vehicle, Please remove old floor mats before installing new floor liners",
  "highlights": [
    "They securely attach to your vehicle using the original factory clasps, keeping the floor liners firmly in place and preventing unwanted shifting during daily driving.",
    "The raised edges provide maximum vehicle coverage, Floor Liners accurately and completely line the vehicle carpet giving absolute interior protection.",
    "Specially designed channels ensure the liner effectively contain the liquid to keep your vehicle and shoes clean, non-slip design for safe driving."
  ],
